From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: domicile CI <ci@domicile.invalid>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] domicile: the members the system libraries replaced go

Battery, backlight, audio and the application search are libraries on
the shell's system calls now, so `searchApps()` and the mixer's
interfaces -- DomicileAppSearch, DomicileDesktopEntry, DomicileBookmark,
DomicileAudioCard, DomicileAudioChoice, DomicileAudioDevice,
DomicileAudioStream, DomicileAudioLevel and DomicileAudioLevelsEvent --
leave the module, and their IDL and generated bindings leave the lists
here.

Verified: not built. This repository cannot build Chromium; the engine
job builds it on `crux`.
---
 .../bindings/generated_in_modules.gni         | 20 -------------------
 .../renderer/bindings/idl_in_modules.gni      | 10 ----------
 2 files changed, 30 deletions(-)

